body:
_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

**非相対インポートの検証を追加してください**

相対パスでないインポートをそのまま返していますが、これによりプロジェクト外のnode_modulesへのアクセスが可能になる可能性があります。



```diff
  static safeResolveImport(importPath: string, fromFile: string, projectPath: string): string | null {
    try {
      if (importPath.startsWith('.')) {
        const resolved = path.resolve(path.dirname(fromFile), importPath);
        return this.validateProjectPath(resolved, projectPath) ? resolved : null;
      }
-     return importPath; // 相対パスでない場合はそのまま返す
+     // 非相対パスの場合、node_modules内での解決を試みる
+     const nodeModulesPath = path.join(projectPath, 'node_modules', importPath);
+     if (this.validateProjectPath(nodeModulesPath, projectPath)) {
+       return importPath;
+     }
+     // ビルトインモジュールの場合はそのまま返す
+     const builtinModules = ['fs', 'path', 'http', 'https', 'crypto', 'os', 'util'];
+     if (builtinModules.includes(importPath.split('/')[0])) {
+       return importPath;
+     }
+     return null;
    } catch {
      return null;
    }
  }
```

<!-- suggestion_start -->

<details>
<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>

> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**
> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.

```suggestion
  static safeResolveImport(importPath: string, fromFile: string, projectPath: string): string | null {
    try {
      if (importPath.startsWith('.')) {
        const resolved = path.resolve(path.dirname(fromFile), importPath);
        return this.validateProjectPath(resolved, projectPath) ? resolved : null;
      }
      // 非相対パスの場合、node_modules内での解決を試みる
      const nodeModulesPath = path.join(projectPath, 'node_modules', importPath);
      if (this.validateProjectPath(nodeModulesPath, projectPath)) {
        return importPath;
      }
      // ビルトインモジュールの場合はそのまま返す
      const builtinModules = ['fs', 'path', 'http', 'https', 'crypto', 'os', 'util'];
      if (builtinModules.includes(importPath.split('/')[0])) {
        return importPath;
      }
      return null;
    } catch {
      return null;
    }
  }
```

</details>

<!-- suggestion_end -->

<details>
<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In src/utils/pathSecurity.ts around lines 81 to 91, the method safeResolveImport
currently returns non-relative import paths as-is, which may allow access to
node_modules outside the project. To fix this, add validation for non-relative
imports by resolving their absolute paths and checking if they reside within the
projectPath using validateProjectPath. Return the resolved path if valid,
otherwise return null to prevent unauthorized access.
```

</details>

<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:medusa:lion -->

