body:
_🧹 Nitpick (assertive)_

**Add edge case testing for extreme values**

Consider testing edge cases like very large numbers, scientific notation, and precision limits.



```typescript
it('handles large numbers correctly', async () => {
  const onUpdate = vi.fn();

  render(NumberField, {
    props: {
      label: 'Test Number',
      value: 0,
      onUpdate,
    },
  });

  const input = screen.getByRole('spinbutton');
  await fireEvent.input(input, { target: { value: '999999999' } });

  expect(onUpdate).toHaveBeenCalledWith(999999999);
});
```

<details>
<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In frontend/src/lib/desktop/components/forms/NumberField.test.ts around lines
