body:
![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

Similar to the progress seed, this loop executes a `DELETE` query for each user ID, which is inefficient. This can be optimized into a single `DELETE` statement using `inArray` from `drizzle-orm`. You'll need to import `inArray` from `drizzle-orm` at the top of the file.

```suggestion
    if (seedUserIds.length > 0) {
      await db.delete(authUser).where(inArray(authUser.userId, seedUserIds));
      logger.debug(`Removed ${seedUserIds.length} seeded users.`);
    }
```

