_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

**Add validation for alarm volume range.**

The `alarmVolume` setter should validate that the value is within the documented range of 0-100 to prevent invalid configurations.

Add validation to the setter:

```diff
 public void setAlarmVolume(Integer alarmVolume) {
+    if (alarmVolume != null && (alarmVolume < 0 || alarmVolume > 100)) {
+        throw new IllegalArgumentException("Alarm volume must be between 0 and 100");
+    }
     this.alarmVolume = alarmVolume;
 }
```

