body:
_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

**フォントスケーリングロジックを見直してください。**

現在の実装では、より大きなデバイス（タブレット）でフォントサイズが0.85倍に縮小されますが、これは高齢者向けアクセシビリティの観点から逆効果です。


高齢者向けアプリでは、タブレットでフォントサイズを大きくするべきです：

```diff
export const responsiveFontSize = (size: number) => {
  const scale = screenWidth / 375;
  const newSize = size * scale;

  if (isTablet()) {
-    return Math.round(PixelRatio.roundToNearestPixel(newSize * 0.85));
+    return Math.round(PixelRatio.roundToNearestPixel(newSize * 1.1));
  }

  return Math.round(PixelRatio.roundToNearestPixel(newSize));
};
```

これにより、タブレットでより読みやすいフォントサイズが提供されます。


<!-- suggestion_start -->

<details>
<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>

> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**
> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.

```suggestion
// レスポンシブなフォントサイズ
export const responsiveFontSize = (size: number) => {
  const scale = screenWidth / 375; // iPhone 8をベースサイズとする
  const newSize = size * scale;

  if (isTablet()) {
    return Math.round(PixelRatio.roundToNearestPixel(newSize * 1.1));
  }

  return Math.round(PixelRatio.roundToNearestPixel(newSize));
};
```

</details>

<!-- suggestion_end -->

<details>
<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In src/utils/responsive.ts around lines 29 to 39, the current responsiveFontSize
function reduces font size by multiplying by 0.85 on tablets, which is
counterproductive for accessibility. Modify the logic so that on tablets, the
font size is increased instead of decreased, for example by multiplying newSize
by a factor greater than 1 (such as 1.15) before rounding and returning it. This
change will ensure larger, more readable fonts on tablets for elderly users.
```

</details>

