_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

**Consider browser cleanup on workflow failure.**

The browser remains open even on workflow failure, which could lead to resource leaks in automated environments.



Consider adding cleanup options:

```diff
         } finally {
-            // Keep browser open for further automation
-            this.log('info', 'Login workflow completed - browser remains open for further automation');
+            if (results.success) {
+                this.log('info', 'Login workflow completed - browser remains open for further automation');
+            } else {
+                this.log('warn', 'Login workflow failed - consider calling closeBrowser() to prevent resource leaks');
+            }
         }
```


