```
In browser-automation/admin-login.js around lines 252 to 254, the current code
keeps the browser open after login workflow completion but does not handle
browser cleanup on workflow failure, risking resource leaks. Modify the code to
include error handling that ensures the browser is properly closed or cleaned up
if the workflow fails, such as adding a try-catch block around the workflow and
closing the browser in the catch or finally block to prevent resource leaks.
```

