![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

The GraphQL query could be simplified by removing the repository wrapper since you are only interested in the issue's parent. This reduces the amount of data being transferred and parsed.

Consider changing the query to:

```graphql
query($childId: ID!) {
  node(id: $childId) {
    ... on Issue {
      parent {
        id
      }
    }
  }
}
```

```go
query($childId: ID!) {
		node(id: $childId) {
			... on Issue {
				parent {
					id
				}
			}
		}
	}
```

