body:
![high](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/high-priority.svg)

Improve error handling by logging the full exception traceback for easier debugging. Also, create the `GenerativeModel` instance once at the module level for efficiency, instead of on every function call.

```python
import logging

logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)
model = genai.GenerativeModel('gemini-2.0-flash')

def advocate_idea(idea: str, temperature: float = 0.5) -> Dict[str, Any]:
    """Generate advocacy for an idea using Gemini API."""
    try:
        prompt = (
            f"以下のアイデアについて、擁護者としてその良い点・メリットを3つ挙げてください。\n"
            f"【アイデア】\n{idea}\n"
        )
        response = model.generate_content(
            prompt,
            generation_config=genai.types.GenerationConfig(temperature=temperature)
        )
        return {"status": "success", "advocacy": response.text if response.text else ""}
    except Exception as e:
        logging.error(f"Error in advocate_idea for idea '{idea[:50]}...':", exc_info=True)
        return {"status": "error", "message": str(e)}
```

