![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

This file, and the other `hook_*_example_input.txt` files, contain multiple JSON objects concatenated on a single line. This makes them very difficult to read and parse visually.

For better readability and to adhere to a common standard, please format these files as **JSON Lines** (`.jsonl`), where each line is a valid JSON object.

For example, this file would become:
```json
{"session_id":"521e5f8d-08a9-4abc-a707-d7eb63b4f639","transcript_path":"/home/liam/.claude/projects/-home-liam-code-cctoast-wsl/521e5f8d-08a9-4abc-a707-d7eb63b4f639.jsonl","cwd":"/home/liam/code/cctoast-wsl","hook_event_name":"Notification","message":"Claude needs your permission to use Bash"}
{"session_id":"521e5f8d-08a9-4abc-a707-d7eb63b4f639","transcript_path":"/home/liam/.claude/projects/-home-liam-code-cctoast-wsl/521e5f8d-08a9-4abc-a707-d7eb63b4f639.jsonl","cwd":"/home/liam/code/cctoast-wsl","hook_event_name":"Notification","message":"Claude needs your permission to use Bash"}
{"session_id":"521e5f8d-08a9-4abc-a707-d7eb63b4f639","transcript_path":"/home/liam/.claude/projects/-home-liam-code-cctoast-wsl/521e5f8d-08a9-4abc-a707-d7eb63b4f639.jsonl","cwd":"/home/liam/code/cctoast-wsl","hook_event_name":"Notification","message":"Claude needs your permission to use Bash"}
{"session_id":"1a76d767-d5e1-4a54-b404-03cb64cebbb9","transcript_path":"/home/liam/.claude/projects/-home-liam-code-cctoast-wsl/1a76d767-d5e1-4a54-b404-03cb64cebbb9.jsonl","cwd":"/home/liam/code/cctoast-wsl","hook_event_name":"Notification","message":"Claude needs your permission to use Bash"}
```
This also applies to `hook_posttooluse_example_input.txt`, `hook_pretooluse_example_input.txt`, and `hook_userpromptsubmit_example_input.txt`.

