This 1-second artificial delay in booking creation will slow down the user experience. Consider removing this simulated delay or making it configurable for testing environments only.
```suggestion
        // Simulate API delay (configurable via BOOKING_DELAY_MS environment variable)
        const delay = parseInt(process.env.BOOKING_DELAY_MS, 10) || 0;
        if (delay > 0) {
            await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, delay));
        }
```

