body:
The fallback clipboard implementation creates DOM elements but doesn't clean up event listeners. Consider using a more robust fallback or checking if the textArea is properly removed in all error cases.
```suggestion
      try {
        textArea.value = text;
        textArea.style.position = 'absolute';
        textArea.style.left = '-999999px';
        document.body.appendChild(textArea);
        textArea.select();
        document.execCommand('copy');
      } finally {
        // Ensure the textarea is removed from the DOM
        document.body.removeChild(textArea);
      }
```

