body:
Both the touchstart and click event listeners perform the same operations (preventDefault and jump). Consider extracting the event handler into a separate function to reduce code duplication and improve maintainability.
```suggestion
// Shared event handler for jump-related events
function handleJumpEvent(event) {
    event.preventDefault();
    jump();
}

canvas.addEventListener('touchstart', handleJumpEvent);

// Also add click event as fallback for non-touch devices that use mouse
canvas.addEventListener('click', handleJumpEvent);
```

