+        emotion
+      };

body:
_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

**Extract duplicate headers extraction logic into a helper function.**

The headers extraction logic is duplicated. This violates the DRY principle and makes maintenance more difficult.

Add a helper function at the class level:

```diff
+	private extractHeaders(req: HttpRequest): Record<string, string> {
+		const headers: Record<string, string> = {};
+		req.forEach((key, value) => {
+			headers[key] = value;
+		});
+		return headers;
+	}
```

Then use it in both locations:

```diff
-				const headers: Record<string, string> = {};
-				req.forEach((key, value) => {
-					headers[key] = value;
-				});
+				const headers = this.extractHeaders(req);
```


Also applies to: 312-315

<details>
<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In packages/manager/src/server.ts around lines 111 to 114 and also 312 to 315,
the headers extraction logic from the request is duplicated. To fix this, create
a helper function at the class level that takes a request object and returns a
headers record by iterating over the request headers. Replace the duplicated
code in both locations by calling this new helper function to extract headers,
ensuring the code follows the DRY principle and is easier to maintain.
```

</details>

