**Missing exercises property in Workout interface.**

The Workout interface appears incomplete as it lacks an `exercises` property to link exercises to workouts, which would be essential for a workout application.



Consider adding the exercises property:

```diff
export interface Workout {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  description?: string;
+ exercises?: Exercise[];
  start_time?: string;
  end_time?: string;
  created_at?: string;
}
```

