In types/index.ts around lines 20 to 27, the Workout interface is missing an
exercises property that should link exercises to the workout. Add an exercises
property to the Workout interface, defining it as an array of Exercise objects
or the appropriate type representing individual exercises, to properly associate
exercises with each workout.
```

</details>

