_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

**Improve accessibility for social media links.**

Using emoji icons without proper alt text creates accessibility issues for screen readers.



```diff
                  <motion.a
                    key={social.name}
                    href={social.url}
+                   aria-label={`Follow us on ${social.name}`}
                    className="w-10 h-10 bg-coffee-dark/50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg hover:bg-coffee-gold hover:text-coffee-dark transition-all duration-200"
                    whileHover={{ scale: 1.1 }}
                    whileTap={{ scale: 0.9 }}
                    initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}
                    whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
                    transition={{ duration: 0.5, delay: index * 0.1 }}
                    viewport={{ once: true }}
                  >
-                    {social.icon}
+                    <span aria-hidden="true">{social.icon}</span>
                  </motion.a>
```

