<details>
<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In shinmen-coffee/src/components/navigation/Footer.tsx around lines 86 to 102,
the social media links use icons without accessible labels, causing issues for
screen readers. Add appropriate aria-label attributes to each motion.a element
using the social.name or a descriptive text to improve accessibility. This
ensures screen readers can identify the purpose of each link properly.
```

