- Add CSS for `.copy-toast`, `.copy-toast--success`, and `.copy-toast--error` to style the feedback (e.g., green for success, red for error, with some padding and positioning).
- If you use a UI library with a built-in toast/alert component, replace the inline divs with the appropriate component.

