<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In frontend/packages/ai-agents/src/security/inputSanitizer.ts around lines 120
to 126, the file extension validation only checks the last extension, which can
be bypassed by files with double extensions. Update the validation to check the
entire filename for any disallowed extensions or ensure that only a single,
allowed extension is present at the end of the filename. This can be done by
splitting the filename on dots and verifying all extensions or by using a
stricter regex to validate the file extension securely.
```

