> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**
> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.

```suggestion
  let mockRegistry: { get?: (key: string) => unknown } | undefined;
  try {
    const mockModule = await import('../tests/setup/mock-factory');
    mockRegistry = mockModule.mockRegistry;
  } catch (error) {
    // existing error handling
  }

  if (!mockRegistry?.get) {
    return {
      allValid: false,
      results: [
        {
          mockName: 'mock-registry',
          isValid: false,
          error: 'Imported mock registry has no get() method',
        },
      ],
      summary: 'Critical error: Invalid mock-registry interface',
    };
