```

</details>

<!-- suggestion_end -->

<details>
<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In scripts/validate-mocks.ts around lines 170 to 174, the code imports
mockRegistry but does not verify that it has a callable get method, which can
cause a TypeError later. Add a check after importing to confirm mockRegistry is
defined and that mockRegistry.get is a function. If not, throw a clear error
explaining the missing or invalid get method to fail fast with a helpful
diagnostic message.
```

