<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In shinmen-coffee/src/components/navigation/Footer.tsx around lines 67 to 80,
the email input and subscribe button lack email validation and form submission
handling. Wrap the input and button in a form element, add a state to track the
email input, implement a function to validate the email format on submit, and
handle the form submission to prevent default behavior and provide user feedback
or error messages if the email is invalid.
```

</details>

