body:
**Duplicate function definition found**

There are two identical definitions of the `valuable_str` function in this file:

```cpp
// First definition at lines 45-49
std::string valuable_str(const Valuable& v) {
    std::ostringstream ss;
    ss << v; // Use operator<< instead of protected print()
    return ss.str();
}

// Second definition at lines 148-152
std::string valuable_str(const Valuable& v) {
    std::ostringstream ss;
    ss << v;  // Use operator<< instead of protected print()
    return ss.str();
}
```

This will cause compilation errors due to the duplicate symbol. Please remove one of these definitions.

