body:
logic: Creating new AuthService instance here while also using @EnvironmentObject for authService could cause duplicate services. Use dependency injection instead.

```suggestion
    init(authService: AuthService) {
        _mailService = StateObject(wrappedValue: MailService(authService: authService))
    }
```

