The error from `firestoreClient.GetSessionByThread` is checked only for `nil`. It would be beneficial to handle specific errors, such as `NotFoundError`, to provide more informative responses or take appropriate actions. For example, you could log the error with more context or return a specific message to the user.

```go
sessionMapping, err := firestoreClient.GetSessionByThread(r.Context(), spaceID, threadID)
