_⚠️ Potential issue_

**Critical: Incorrect configuration variable name**

Line 165 uses `disable_samples_on_pii_tags` but according to the PR objectives, the configuration variable should be `disable_samples_on_pii_columns`. This mismatch will cause the PII exclusion logic to never activate since it's checking for the wrong variable name.



```diff
-  {% if elementary.get_config_var('disable_samples_on_pii_tags') %}
+  {% if elementary.get_config_var('disable_samples_on_pii_columns') %}
```

This needs to be consistent with the configuration variable names defined in the PR objectives.

<!-- suggestion_start -->

<details>
<summary>📝 Committable suggestion</summary>

> ‼️ **IMPORTANT**
> Carefully review the code before committing. Ensure that it accurately replaces the highlighted code, contains no missing lines, and has no issues with indentation. Thoroughly test & benchmark the code to ensure it meets the requirements.

