body:
**Test Coverage Improvement**: The Product_coefficient_handling_test should be expanded to cover more edge cases:

```cpp
// Current test covers basic cases
BOOST_AUTO_TEST_CASE(Product_coefficient_handling_test)
{
    DECL_VA(x);

    // Test direct multiplication with negative coefficients
    auto _1 = -1_v * x;
    auto _2 = x * -1_v;
    BOOST_TEST(_1 == _2);  // Order independence

    // Test coefficient normalization
    auto _3 = (-1_v * x) * (-1_v * x);
    BOOST_TEST(_3 == (x ^ 2));  // Double negation

    // Test polynomial coefficient handling
    auto _4 = -1_v * x + x * x;
    auto _5 = (x ^ 2) - x;
    BOOST_TEST(_4 == _5);  // Equivalent polynomial forms
}
```

Recommended additional test cases:
1. Test with larger polynomials (>2 terms)
2. Test with zero coefficients (e.g., `0_v * x`)
3. Test with non-integer coefficients (e.g., fractions)
4. Test with nested products and more complex expressions

