body:
The version number used in the INSERT statement is 'article.version + 1' but 'article.version' refers to the old version before the UPDATE. This could cause version inconsistency between the main table and versions table.
```suggestion
      const updatedArticle = await db.one(
        'SELECT version FROM kb_articles WHERE id = $1',
        [article.id]
      );

      await db.none(
        'INSERT INTO kb_article_versions (id, article_id, version, body_markdown, modified_by_id, created_at) VALUES ($1,$2,$3,$4,$5,$6)',
        [require('uuid').v4(), article.id, updatedArticle.version, content, req.user.id, now]
```

