_🛠️ Refactor suggestion_

**Add error handling for clipboard operations.**

The `navigator.clipboard.writeText()` method can fail (e.g., in non-secure contexts or if clipboard permissions are denied), but there's no error handling or user feedback.



Apply this diff to add proper error handling:

```diff
-  const copyLogs = () => {
-    navigator.clipboard.writeText(logs.join('\n'));
-  };
+  const copyLogs = async () => {
+    try {
+      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(logs.join('\n'));
+      // Optional: Add success feedback here
+    } catch (error) {
+      // Fallback for browsers without clipboard API
+      const textArea = document.createElement('textarea');
+      textArea.value = logs.join('\n');
+      document.body.appendChild(textArea);
+      textArea.select();
+      document.execCommand('copy');
+      document.body.removeChild(textArea);
+    }
+  };
```

