_🧹 Nitpick (assertive)_

**Solid behavioural test; add a renderer-state assertion for completeness**

The new test covers value, cursor and view – nice.  
To guarantee the command was executed in *edit* context, also assert that the
renderer kept edit-mode enabled after `CLEAR`, e.g.:

```diff
 assertEqual((uint8_t)0, item.view);
+assertTrue(renderer.isInEditMode());
```

This makes sure future refactors don’t silently exit edit mode.  



