![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

The `options` parameter in `User.findByIdAndUpdate` should be explicitly checked for `{ new: true }` to ensure the function is called with the expected options. This makes the test more precise.

```suggestion
  expect(User.findByIdAndUpdate).
  toHaveBeenCalledWith(
    'user1',
    expect.objectContaining({ avatar: expect.stringContaining('/uploads/user1/') }),
    { new: true }
  );
```

