body:
![high](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/high-priority.svg)

Specifically handle the 'file not found' case (`ENOENT`) in `loadDatabase` and re-throw or log other unexpected errors instead of silently returning a new, empty database.

```typescript
try {
    const data = await fs.readFile(filePath, 'utf8');
    return JSON.parse(data) as Database;
  } catch (error: any) {
    if (error.code === 'ENOENT') {
      return createDatabase();
    }
    throw error;
  }
```

