body:
If the initial fetch fails, the converterPromise remains set to a resolved null value, preventing any future reattempts to load the converter. Consider resetting or invalidating converterPromise when a fetch fails to allow for retry logic on subsequent calls.
```suggestion
      (error) => {
        converterPromise = null; // Reset to allow retries
        return null;
      }
```

