[nitpick] Calling initializeOxyStore both immediately and again after hydration could lead to duplicate store initialization; consider guarding against multiple invocations or relying solely on the hydration callback.
```suggestion
// Track whether the store has already been initialized
let isStoreInitialized = false;

// Initialize store once hydration is finished to ensure tokens are available
useOxyStore.persist.onFinishHydration(() => {
  if (!isStoreInitialized) {
    initializeOxyStore(oxyServices);
    isStoreInitialized = true;
  }
});

// Also run initialization immediately in case hydration already occurred
if (!isStoreInitialized) {
  initializeOxyStore(oxyServices);
  isStoreInitialized = true;
}
```

